6. VENDORED TRUST MATERIAL INSIDE THIRD-PARTY BINARIES
===============================================================================

Some of the third-party binaries credited in section 3 carry trust material of
their own: certificate and key data embedded by their upstream vendors when those
binaries were built. That material belongs to the vendored components, it is not
remediable from the sources in this repository, and none of it is reproduced
anywhere in the .NET tree.

This notice records only that the material exists, because it travels with the
attributed components and a redistributor of those binaries should know that it
does. The locators, the assessment and the required action are recorded in
docs/SECRETS.md. No values appear in this file, and none may be added to it: this
is an attribution notice, not a credential inventory.
